# 書庫管理 (design 11.20), for tools/ui_run.py: an archive object made
# from the template 空書庫 out of the 原紙箱 into the BTRON window and
# opened; the window moved aside and the link 実身/仮身 carried out of
# the text TADjsについて into it; the panel that asks lists what was
# found, and Enter (its 〈作成〉) makes the book. 書籍情報 (Ctrl+I) and
# 実身名一覧 (Ctrl+L), panels of the data box, shown and put away with
# Esc; the book carried into the
# BTRON window and taken out after the desktop asked; a second link put
# in refused (one book to an archive); the menu opened and 書籍の削除
# chosen, which leaves the archive empty.
click 990 48
wait 300
drag 960 380 250 60
wait 1000
key 28
wait 800
dclick 250 60
expect archive: ready empty
wait 800
drag 500 163 800 413
wait 500
shot arc_empty
# the window's work area is at 510,428 from here
drag 315 331 760 716
expect archive: found 1 objects
expect archive: asked to make
wait 500
shot arc_found
# 〈作成〉, the emphasised button
key 28
expect archive: packed 1 objects
wait 800
# the archive's window given the keys again (the panel had them)
click 760 716
wait 300
shot arc_book
key 0c 1
expect archive: info shown
wait 300
shot arc_info
key 29
expect archive: info put away
wait 300
key 0f 1
expect archive: list shown
wait 300
shot arc_list
key 29
expect archive: list put away
wait 300
# the book's 付箋 (526,500-676,530) carried into the BTRON window; Enter answers the desktop
drag 560 512 300 110
wait 1000
shot arc_ask
key 28
expect archive: unpacked 1 objects
wait 1000
shot arc_unpacked
drag 315 331 760 716
expect archive: drop refused
click 760 716
wait 500
shot arc_refused
# the window moved up; its menu, and 書籍の削除
drag 700 413 700 213
wait 500
click 800 450 1
wait 500
shot arc_menu
move 805 470
wait 150
move 830 520
wait 150
move 830 550
wait 150
click 830 550
expect archive: deleted the book
wait 500
shot arc_deleted
# nothing it did was refused for want of a right
absent !OACV!
